  "description": "The temple of the god \u0160ara, Ebursasa (\u201cHouse of Beautiful Jars\u201d), was located in the B\u0101b-Lugalerra district of Babylon, in the western half of the inner city. According to the Babylonian topographical text Tintir = Babylon Tablet IV, it was one of three temples in that part of Babylon.",
